{"seq":2,"slug":"stream-reactive","title":"Stream 与响应式编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/async-concurrency/stream-reactive","wordCount":1117,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"stream-与响应式编程\">Stream 与响应式编程</h1><p>Future 表示<strong>一次性</strong>的异步值，而 Stream 表示<strong>连续的</strong>异步事件序列——从用户输入、WebSocket 消息到文件逐行读取，任何随时间推移产生多个值的数据源都适合用 Stream 建模。Dart 的 Stream API 提供了丰富的转换和组合操作符，配合 <code>async*</code>/<code>yield</code> 语法糖，可以构建声明式的数据处理管道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先立起本篇的几张底牌，后文所有论证都围绕它们展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>一句话定义</th>\n<th>在本篇中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单订阅 Stream</td>\n<td>恰好一个监听者、订阅前事件会被缓冲</td>\n<td>文件读取、HTTP 响应体等来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广播 Stream</td>\n<td>任意多监听者、错过即丢失</td>\n<td>UI 事件、WebSocket 等来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>StreamController</td>\n<td>连接命令式生产与声明式消费的桥梁</td>\n<td>自定义 Stream 的标准做法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反压</td>\n<td>下游来不及处理时暂停上游生产</td>\n<td><code>onPause</code>/<code>onResume</code> 的语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>async*</code>/<code>yield</code></td>\n<td>声明式创建 Stream 的生成器语法</td>\n<td>配合 Record 解构构建序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>StreamTransformer</td>\n<td>内置操作符不够时的自定义管道节点</td>\n<td>节流、防抖等定制逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话串起来：Stream 类型决定能几人监听与是否缓冲，StreamController 决定事件如何被生产，<code>async*</code> 与操作符决定数据如何流经管道，反压与订阅取消决定资源是否安全。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单订阅-vs-广播-stream\">单订阅 vs 广播 Stream</h2><p>Dart 的 Stream 分为两种类型，适用场景截然不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>单订阅 Stream</th>\n<th>广播 Stream</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>监听者数量</td>\n<td>恰好 1 个</td>\n<td>任意多个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件缓冲</td>\n<td>有（订阅前产生的事件会缓冲）</td>\n<td>无（错过就丢失）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多次监听</td>\n<td>抛出 StateError</td>\n<td>允许</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型来源</td>\n<td>文件读取、HTTP 响应体</td>\n<td>UI 事件、WebSocket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源释放</td>\n<td>取消订阅时释放</td>\n<td>最后一个监听者取消时释放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 单订阅：文件逐行读取&#10;Stream&lt;String&gt; readLines(String path) {&#10;  return File(path)&#10;      .openRead()&#10;      .transform(utf8.decoder)&#10;      .transform(const LineSplitter());&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 广播：多个组件监听同一事件源&#10;final controller = StreamController&lt;int&gt;.broadcast();&#10;controller.stream.listen((n) =&gt; print(&#39;A: $n&#39;));&#10;controller.stream.listen((n) =&gt; print(&#39;B: $n&#39;));&#10;controller.add(42); // 输出 A: 42 和 B: 42\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 单订阅：文件逐行读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Stream&#x3C;String> readLines(String path) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return File(path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .openRead()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .transform(utf8.decoder)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      .transform(const LineSplitter());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 广播：多个组件监听同一事件源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final controller = StreamController&#x3C;int>.broadcast();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>controller.stream.listen((n) => print('A: $n'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>controller.stream.listen((n) => print('B: $n'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>controller.add(42); // 输出 A: 42 和 B: 42</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 单订阅&#10;        S1[数据源] --&gt; B1[缓冲区] --&gt; L1[唯一监听者]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 广播&#10;        S2[数据源] --&gt; L2[监听者 A]&#10;        S2 --&gt; L3[监听者 B]&#10;        S2 --&gt; L4[监听者 C]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 单订阅\n        S1[数据源] --&gt; B1[缓冲区] --&gt; L1[唯一监听者]\n    end\n    subgraph 广播\n        S2[数据源] --&gt; L2[监听者 A]\n        S2 --&gt; L3[监听者 B]\n        S2 --&gt; L4[监听者 C]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"streamcontroller-创建自定义-stream\">StreamController：创建自定义 Stream</h2><p>StreamController 是连接命令式事件产生和声明式 Stream 消费的桥梁：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"class SensorDataStream {&#10;  final _controller = StreamController&lt;SensorReading&gt;();&#10;  Timer? _pollTimer;&#10;&#10;  Stream&lt;SensorReading&gt; get stream =&gt; _controller.stream;&#10;&#10;  void start({Duration interval = const Duration(milliseconds: 100)}) {&#10;    _pollTimer = Timer.periodic(interval, (_) {&#10;      final reading = _readHardwareSensor();&#10;      if (!_controller.isClosed) {&#10;        _controller.add(reading);&#10;      }&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  void reportError(Object error, [StackTrace? trace]) {&#10;    _controller.addError(error, trace);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;void&gt; dispose() async {&#10;    _pollTimer?.cancel();&#10;    await _controller.close(); // 发送 done 事件&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class SensorDataStream {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final _controller = StreamController&#x3C;SensorReading>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Timer? _pollTimer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Stream&#x3C;SensorReading> get stream => _controller.stream;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void start({Duration interval = const Duration(milliseconds: 100)}) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _pollTimer = Timer.periodic(interval, (_) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final reading = _readHardwareSensor();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if (!_controller.isClosed) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _controller.add(reading);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void reportError(Object error, [StackTrace? trace]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _controller.addError(error, trace);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;void> dispose() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _pollTimer?.cancel();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await _controller.close(); // 发送 done 事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>StreamController 的 <code>onListen</code>/<code>onCancel</code>/<code>onPause</code>/<code>onResume</code> 回调实现了<strong>反压</strong>（backpressure）——当下游消费者来不及处理时暂停上游生产：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"StreamController&lt;int&gt; createPausableCounter() {&#10;  late Timer timer;&#10;  final controller = StreamController&lt;int&gt;(&#10;    onListen: () =&gt; timer = Timer.periodic(&#10;      Duration(milliseconds: 10),&#10;      (t) =&gt; controller.add(t.tick),&#10;    ),&#10;    onPause: () =&gt; timer.cancel(),&#10;    onResume: () =&gt; timer = Timer.periodic(&#10;      Duration(milliseconds: 10),&#10;      (t) =&gt; controller.add(t.tick),&#10;    ),&#10;    onCancel: () =&gt; timer.cancel(),&#10;  );&#10;  late StreamController&lt;int&gt; controller;&#10;  return controller;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>StreamController&#x3C;int> createPausableCounter() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  late Timer timer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final controller = StreamController&#x3C;int>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onListen: () => timer = Timer.periodic(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Duration(milliseconds: 10),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (t) => controller.add(t.tick),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onPause: () => timer.cancel(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onResume: () => timer = Timer.periodic(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Duration(milliseconds: 10),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (t) => controller.add(t.tick),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onCancel: () => timer.cancel(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  late StreamController&#x3C;int> controller;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return controller;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"async-生成器函数\">async* 生成器函数</h2><p><code>async*</code> 函数结合 <code>yield</code> 和 <code>yield*</code> 提供了创建 Stream 的声明式语法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 基础 async* 生成器&#10;Stream&lt;int&gt; fibonacci() async* {&#10;  int a = 0, b = 1;&#10;  while (true) {&#10;    yield a;&#10;    (a, b) = (b, a + b); // Record 解构交换&#10;    await Future.delayed(Duration(milliseconds: 100));&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// yield* 委托给另一个 Stream&#10;Stream&lt;LogEntry&gt; allLogs() async* {&#10;  yield* systemLogs();   // 先发送系统日志&#10;  yield* applicationLogs(); // 再发送应用日志&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 带取消检测的生成器&#10;Stream&lt;int&gt; countDown(int from) async* {&#10;  for (var i = from; i &gt;= 0; i--) {&#10;    yield i;&#10;    await Future.delayed(Duration(seconds: 1));&#10;    // 如果下游取消订阅，生成器会在下一个 yield 处自动终止&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 基础 async* 生成器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Stream&#x3C;int> fibonacci() async* {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int a = 0, b = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  while (true) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    yield a;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (a, b) = (b, a + b); // Record 解构交换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await Future.delayed(Duration(milliseconds: 100));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// yield* 委托给另一个 Stream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Stream&#x3C;LogEntry> allLogs() async* {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  yield* systemLogs();   // 先发送系统日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  yield* applicationLogs(); // 再发送应用日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 带取消检测的生成器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Stream&#x3C;int> countDown(int from) async* {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (var i = from; i >= 0; i--) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    yield i;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await Future.delayed(Duration(seconds: 1));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 如果下游取消订阅，生成器会在下一个 yield 处自动终止</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>async*</code> 函数的执行模型：函数体在有人监听时才开始执行，在每个 <code>yield</code> 处暂停等待下游消费，监听取消时在下一个 <code>yield</code> 点终止。</p>\n<h2 id=\"stream-转换操作符\">Stream 转换操作符</h2><p>Stream 的转换操作符形成了一条声明式处理管道。核心操作符按功能分类：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 元素转换&#10;stream.map((x) =&gt; x * 2)            // 一对一映射&#10;stream.expand((x) =&gt; [x, x])        // 一对多展开&#10;stream.asyncMap((x) =&gt; fetchData(x)) // 异步映射&#10;stream.asyncExpand((x) =&gt; subStream(x)) // 异步一对多&#10;&#10;// 过滤&#10;stream.where((x) =&gt; x &gt; 0)          // 条件过滤&#10;stream.distinct()                    // 去重（相邻）&#10;stream.skip(5)                       // 跳过前 N 个&#10;stream.take(10)                      // 只取前 N 个&#10;stream.takeWhile((x) =&gt; x &lt; 100)    // 条件截断&#10;&#10;// 聚合（终止操作，返回 Future）&#10;stream.fold(0, (sum, x) =&gt; sum + x) // 累积求和&#10;stream.reduce((a, b) =&gt; a + b)      // 归约&#10;stream.toList()                      // 收集为列表&#10;stream.first                         // 第一个元素&#10;stream.last                          // 最后一个元素\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 元素转换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stream.map((x) => x * 2)            // 一对一映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stream.expand((x) => [x, x])        // 一对多展开</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stream.asyncMap((x) => fetchData(x)) // 异步映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stream.asyncExpand((x) => subStream(x)) // 异步一对多</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stream.where((x) => x > 0)          // 条件过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stream.distinct()                    // 去重（相邻）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stream.skip(5)                       // 跳过前 N 个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stream.take(10)                      // 只取前 N 个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stream.takeWhile((x) => x &#x3C; 100)    // 条件截断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 聚合（终止操作，返回 Future）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stream.fold(0, (sum, x) => sum + x) // 累积求和</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stream.reduce((a, b) => a + b)      // 归约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stream.toList()                      // 收集为列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stream.first                         // 第一个元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stream.last                          // 最后一个元素</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作符</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>背压行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>map</code></td>\n<td><code>Stream&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Stream&lt;R&gt;</code></td>\n<td>同步转换，不影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>asyncMap</code></td>\n<td><code>Stream&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Stream&lt;R&gt;</code></td>\n<td>等待每个 Future 完成后才处理下一个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>asyncExpand</code></td>\n<td><code>Stream&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Stream&lt;R&gt;</code></td>\n<td>等待子 Stream 完成后才处理下一个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>where</code></td>\n<td><code>Stream&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Stream&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>过滤不匹配元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>transform</code></td>\n<td><code>Stream&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Stream&lt;R&gt;</code></td>\n<td>自定义 StreamTransformer</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"streamtransformer-自定义管道节点\">StreamTransformer：自定义管道节点</h2><p>当内置操作符不够时，StreamTransformer 提供了完全控制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 节流（throttle）：在指定时间窗口内只发送第一个事件&#10;StreamTransformer&lt;T, T&gt; throttle&lt;T&gt;(Duration window) {&#10;  return StreamTransformer.fromHandlers(&#10;    handleData: (data, sink) {&#10;      // 简化实现：实际需要维护定时器状态&#10;      sink.add(data);&#10;    },&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 防抖（debounce）：等待静默期后才发送最后一个事件&#10;class DebounceTransformer&lt;T&gt; extends StreamTransformerBase&lt;T, T&gt; {&#10;  final Duration duration;&#10;  DebounceTransformer(this.duration);&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  Stream&lt;T&gt; bind(Stream&lt;T&gt; stream) {&#10;    Timer? timer;&#10;    late T lastValue;&#10;    final controller = StreamController&lt;T&gt;();&#10;&#10;    stream.listen(&#10;      (data) {&#10;        lastValue = data;&#10;        timer?.cancel();&#10;        timer = Timer(duration, () =&gt; controller.add(lastValue));&#10;      },&#10;      onError: controller.addError,&#10;      onDone: () {&#10;        timer?.cancel();&#10;        controller.close();&#10;      },&#10;    );&#10;    return controller.stream;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 节流（throttle）：在指定时间窗口内只发送第一个事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>StreamTransformer&#x3C;T, T> throttle&#x3C;T>(Duration window) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return StreamTransformer.fromHandlers(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    handleData: (data, sink) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // 简化实现：实际需要维护定时器状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      sink.add(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 防抖（debounce）：等待静默期后才发送最后一个事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class DebounceTransformer&#x3C;T> extends StreamTransformerBase&#x3C;T, T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final Duration duration;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  DebounceTransformer(this.duration);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Stream&#x3C;T> bind(Stream&#x3C;T> stream) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Timer? timer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    late T lastValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final controller = StreamController&#x3C;T>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    stream.listen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (data) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        lastValue = data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        timer?.cancel();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        timer = Timer(duration, () => controller.add(lastValue));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      onError: controller.addError,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      onDone: () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        timer?.cancel();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        controller.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return controller.stream;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"await-for-顺序消费-stream\">await for：顺序消费 Stream</h2><p><code>await for</code> 循环逐个处理 Stream 事件，在 Stream 关闭时自动退出：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"Future&lt;int&gt; sumStream(Stream&lt;int&gt; stream) async {&#10;  var sum = 0;&#10;  await for (final value in stream) {&#10;    sum += value;&#10;  }&#10;  return sum; // Stream done 后执行&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 带超时和错误处理&#10;Future&lt;void&gt; processMessages(Stream&lt;Message&gt; messages) async {&#10;  try {&#10;    await for (final msg in messages.timeout(Duration(seconds: 30))) {&#10;      switch (msg) {&#10;        case TextMessage(:var content):&#10;          await handleText(content);&#10;        case BinaryMessage(:var bytes):&#10;          await handleBinary(bytes);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  } on TimeoutException {&#10;    print(&#39;No messages received for 30 seconds&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;int> sumStream(Stream&#x3C;int> stream) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var sum = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await for (final value in stream) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sum += value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return sum; // Stream done 后执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 带超时和错误处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> processMessages(Stream&#x3C;Message> messages) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await for (final msg in messages.timeout(Duration(seconds: 30))) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      switch (msg) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        case TextMessage(:var content):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          await handleText(content);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        case BinaryMessage(:var bytes):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          await handleBinary(bytes);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } on TimeoutException {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print('No messages received for 30 seconds');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>await for</code> 的暂停语义：在处理每个事件期间，Stream 的订阅会被暂停——这实现了自然的反压机制，确保消费者不会被生产者压垮。</p>\n<h2 id=\"stream-与内存泄漏\">Stream 与内存泄漏</h2><p>Stream 订阅是内存泄漏的常见来源。每个 <code>stream.listen()</code> 返回的 StreamSubscription 持有对回调闭包的引用——如果不显式取消，订阅会一直存活：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"class SearchWidget {&#10;  StreamSubscription&lt;String&gt;? _searchSub;&#10;  final _searchController = StreamController&lt;String&gt;();&#10;&#10;  void init() {&#10;    // 正确：保存订阅引用以便取消&#10;    _searchSub = _searchController.stream&#10;        .transform(DebounceTransformer(Duration(milliseconds: 300)))&#10;        .distinct()&#10;        .asyncMap((query) =&gt; searchApi(query))&#10;        .listen((results) =&gt; updateUI(results));&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  void dispose() {&#10;    _searchSub?.cancel(); // 取消订阅&#10;    _searchController.close(); // 关闭 controller&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class SearchWidget {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  StreamSubscription&#x3C;String>? _searchSub;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final _searchController = StreamController&#x3C;String>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void init() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 正确：保存订阅引用以便取消</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _searchSub = _searchController.stream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .transform(DebounceTransformer(Duration(milliseconds: 300)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .distinct()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .asyncMap((query) => searchApi(query))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .listen((results) => updateUI(results));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void dispose() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _searchSub?.cancel(); // 取消订阅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _searchController.close(); // 关闭 controller</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>防泄漏的原则：对于超出当前函数生命周期的 Stream 订阅，始终在对应的生命周期结束回调中取消。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>单订阅 Stream 缓冲订阅前事件、只允许一个监听者；广播 Stream 支持多监听者但错过即丢失，选择取决于数据源语义。</li>\n<li>StreamController 是把命令式事件生产接入声明式消费的桥梁，<code>onListen</code>/<code>onCancel</code>/<code>onPause</code>/<code>onResume</code> 回调实现了反压。</li>\n<li><code>async*</code> + <code>yield</code>/<code>yield*</code> 提供声明式生成语法：函数体在被监听时才执行，每个 <code>yield</code> 处暂停等待消费，取消时在下个 <code>yield</code> 点终止。</li>\n<li><code>await for</code> 逐个消费事件并在处理期间暂停订阅，形成自然的反压；配合 <code>timeout()</code> 与 switch 模式匹配可写出健壮的消息循环。</li>\n<li>内置操作符覆盖转换、过滤、聚合；不足时用 <code>StreamTransformer</code> 自定义管道节点（如节流、防抖）。</li>\n<li>Stream 订阅是常见内存泄漏源：超出函数生命周期的订阅必须在对应生命周期结束回调中 <code>cancel()</code>，并关闭 controller。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参阅 <a href=\"future-async-await\">Future 与 async/await</a> 理解 Stream 底层的事件循环机制，以及 <a href=\"isolate-concurrency\">Isolate 并发模型</a> 了解如何在 Isolate 之间传递 Stream 数据。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Stream 与响应式编程","id":"stream-与响应式编程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"单订阅 vs 广播 Stream","id":"单订阅-vs-广播-stream"},{"level":2,"text":"StreamController：创建自定义 Stream","id":"streamcontroller-创建自定义-stream"},{"level":2,"text":"async\\* 生成器函数","id":"async-生成器函数"},{"level":2,"text":"Stream 转换操作符","id":"stream-转换操作符"},{"level":2,"text":"StreamTransformer：自定义管道节点","id":"streamtransformer-自定义管道节点"},{"level":2,"text":"await for：顺序消费 Stream","id":"await-for-顺序消费-stream"},{"level":2,"text":"Stream 与内存泄漏","id":"stream-与内存泄漏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Future 与 async/await","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/async-concurrency/future-async-await"},"next":{"title":"Isolate 并发模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/async-concurrency/isolate-concurrency"}}